-map.test.ts also reads it (line 28) and asserts that the table under the heading \"## 10. Test map to the Phase 4 stop gate\" has 15 rows (lines 32 and 95-97). It reads only that section, up to the next \"## \" heading, so a Glossary after section 12 does not change it. Name it.\n5. known_risks names a ROOOTS regex. The variable in scripts/path-audit.sh is ROOTS (line 55).\nChange nothing the feedback does not name; copy every hash and path from the earlier plan exactly.\nBefore returning the plan, check every name, line number and claim about behaviour against the files you read, and remove any you did not see.","occurredAt":"2026-11-12T22:20:05.722Z","attribution":{"roleId":null,"actorId":"founder","actualModel":"n/a (human Founder decision)","executionSurface":"founder-terminal"}},"committed_at":"2026-11-12T22:20:05.701Z"},{"seq":"5","event_id":"evt_0ca44cb7-7602-4181-bf69-84e265621151","event":"plan.submitted","outcome":"transition","entry_seq":5,"transition_id":"T3","guard_id":"G3","from_state":"PLANNING","resulting_state":"PLAN_REVIEW","actor":"agent.planner","attribution":{"roleId":"architect","actorId":"gateway:1880c12d-d98d-4a91-b25a-23320aa7f58a","actualModel":"gemini-4-argon","executionSurface":"antigravity"},"scope":{"repo":"MADVenturesLLC/founder-os-build-room","paths":["docs/command-journal-contract.md"],"roomId":"9bdb8cd9-8937-4058-9365-d27439e6142d"},"evidence":[{"ref":"cmd_planner_6d626bf5465a5855c27d8997504cfe97","kind":"plandoc","digest":"7b17f532a3e381e1210b89ca614e530dee0834ef620ee36e704b53096a5fa1fd"}],"overlays":[],"round":0,"occurred_at":"2026-11-12T22:22:39.114Z","payload":{"actor":"agent.planner","event":"plan.submitted","facts":{"planHash":"7b17f532a3e381e1210b89ca614e530dee0834ef620ee36e704b53096a5fa1fd","gatewayOnline":true,"planDocSchemaValid":true},"scope":{"repo":"MADVenturesLLC/founder-os-build-room","paths":["docs/command-journal-contract.md"],"roomId":"9bdb8cd9-8937-4058-9365-d27439e6142d"},"eventId":"evt_0ca44cb7-7602-4181-bf69-8